	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nXT4kBD-V01pZi38p",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 15, DX 10, IQ 10, HT 12, HP 17, WILL 11, PER 10, FP 12, SPEED 5.5, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "ngbdcRpqZUQID4Nin",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 26 (offense 14, protection 12), threat tier standard, appearing 2."
		},
		{
			"id": "nUXeM5fMzZfAqVNNL",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/wereboar.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "n5IgM29vMcWWVo7SJ",
			"text": "Independent build total: 133 points of racial traits plus 4 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nGoFWn0_1jLuD18kg",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Wereboar (SRD 5.1); Wereboar (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "niPSeBMvqxmPkCF5r",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "n2m8wvWvWnyYYOig2",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 140 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nN_1_EZdvqI7-auS8",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nYNWcfJwcuxQm3gbf",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "noUixwZ3X4Wjq3neK",
			"text": "Berserk is the identity: hurt one and it stops defending. The rating sees the frenzy's offense; the note reminds the GM it also stops retreating."
		},
		{
			"id": "nxemwQu7JN-tQjf0f",
			"text": "Wounds dealt by silver do not regenerate."
		},
		{
			"id": "nq1qBnhwT6Co_r14p",
